  "setup": "In Fastmail Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security \u2192 Manage API tokens, select the JMAP protocol and enable Email access. MCP and Dynamic DNS tokens are not supported. Choose Read-only access for reading, or Read-write access to send or trash mail; sending also requires Email submission. API tokens require a plan above Basic. Your token stays on this server.",
